  "details": "The output log doesn't seem to record any messages when a sticker or share is placed in the world. This means that if, for example, a sticker is placed in a way where it's not possible to select it with your laser, or if it causes a crash, it would be difficult to identify which user or which image is causing the issue.\n\nThe output logs should contain enough information to be able to provide useful moderation reports for stickers and shares.",
